      <h1 class="jr-h1">How to Boost Collagen Naturally (and When Food Is Not Enough)</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Most advice on how to boost collagen naturally is a list of foods with no doses
        attached. This is the version with numbers: how much vitamin C, how much protein,
        what the Indian sun
        is doing to the collagen you already have, and the point at which diet alone
        stops being the answer.
      </p>

